# Enterprise Architecture

## Mục tiêu

Enterprise Architecture (EA) là discipline giúp organizations align technology decisions với business objectives. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, EA principles guide decisions về system design, integration patterns, governance structures, và long-term technology direction. Mục tiêu của rule này là cung cấp framework cho việc design và maintain enterprise-scale systems với proper governance và standards.

Enterprise architecture không chỉ là về technology mà còn về people, processes, và governance. Một EA tốt giúp organization đạt được business agility trong khi vẫn maintain operational stability và reduce risk.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Business-IT Alignment**

Technology decisions must support business goals. Understand business capabilities. Map technology to business value. Enable business transformation. Measure technology impact.

**2. Architectural Principles**

Define clear principles. Document decisions. Enforce consistently. Review periodically. Adapt when needed.

**3. Architecture Governance**

Review significant changes. Maintain architectural runway. Ensure compliance. Balance flexibility vs control. Enable innovation within guardrails.

**4. Separation of Concerns**

Clear boundaries between systems. Well-defined interfaces. Minimize coupling. Maximize cohesion. Define ownership.

**5. Reuse and Standardization**

Reuse existing components. Standardize on common patterns. Share infrastructure. Avoid duplication. Build platforms.

**6. Data Architecture**

Define data ownership. Establish data standards. Enable data sharing. Protect sensitive data. Manage data quality.

**7. Integration Architecture**

Define integration patterns. Use standard protocols. Ensure interoperability. Manage dependencies. Plan for scalability.

**8. Security Architecture**

Embed security from design. Defense in depth. Zero trust principles. Compliance by design. Security by default.

**9. Cloud Architecture**

Multi-cloud strategy. Cloud-native patterns. Cost-aware design. Operational excellence. Continuous optimization.

**10. Architecture Evolution**

Incremental change. Technical debt management. Legacy modernization. Innovation adoption. Future-proofing.

